        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "25. The Petitioner had not produced even a single medical bill."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "007356d904934ad18dc44c563b73e442_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However he had produced two discharge summary which are marked as Ex.P8 and 9."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2f2931e35fba40ef9e1f4640904aacee_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per Ex,P8 the Petitioner took treatment at Jayanagar Orthopaedic Centre from 03-10-2022 to 08-10-2022."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "17cd50c1768f43edb7878dff685c7282_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Ex,P8 discloses that, the Petitioner took treatment at MVJ Hospital from 03-10-2022 to 03-10-2022."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f69422c9513b461fbf0745a0d17cdf92_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, by considering the period of treatment taken as inpatient this tribunal awarded reasonable compensation of Rs.8,000/-\nunder the head Medical expenses, Transportation, food, Nourishment and conveyance charges."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9a7aa9b57cd94a41bf2bca23760b2abf_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n14 SCCH - 19 MVC.7057/2022 26."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ce5b78c00bf04d668eb7cd932972ef02_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "To prove the assessment of disability, the Petitioner got examined one Doctor Shri.Somashekar as Pw-3."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5327b39dcfc040da93519a220054515e_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the chief examination affidavit the doctor deposed that, on examination it is found that,\nthe Petitioner walks with pain and limping, Diffuse swelling of left lower limb and Surgical scars are seen over left knee, leg and ankle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2492890116e74238a96138151f5e783b_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Recent X-ray shows that United fracture of both bones of left leg with implants in situ as both sites."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e943cffdc4d642baaea5635c54b6b3f0_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The doctor assessed the total disability of left lower limb at 42%\nand that of to the whole body of the Petitioner at 21%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cf909f336cad4f8ea9beadc5e24010f0_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the Cross examination doctor had deposed that, \" I am not a treated doctor at any stage."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d6f5da2862084c37b88b0db3ab3208e7_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is true to suggest that, fractures are united as per recent x-rays."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aac85ee71f5c4a7fab3617c9f1204e8b_113",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is true to suggest that, there is no bone loss and no shortening limb."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7c5d304de28f424981cbe10b857dffd0_114",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is true to suggest that, as per guidelines 50% of disability of particulars limb cannot taken towards the whole body.\""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "08fdf8d3335a4da0b14fcde92683cb58_115",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHowever by considering the nature of the injury and evidence of the doctor, this Tribunal had taken the disability of the Petitioner at 15% to the whole body."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e8509ed85e8e4e5b9ec367e245338fe0_116",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "27. It is contended that prior to the accident, the Petitioner was Painter by Profession and was 15 SCCH - 19 MVC.7057/2022 earning Rs.25,000/- p.m and due to accidental injuries he is not able to carry on his work as before the accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "badbe81f718c4452b4496ee38b13e6ce_117",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Petitioner had not produced any document to prove his income and avocation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "210fd51495f74de1b9893efbc18c9369_118",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In present days the Coolie worker get Rs.500/- to 600/- per day."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a794aa5100614ef883accd6f87cea1de_119",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However by considering the age and occupation of petitioner this Tribunal taken the monthly income of the Petitioner at Rs.16,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1b65a55346634943b62e686152188069_120",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "28. As per Ex.P10 Notarized Copy of Aadhaar card date of birth of the Petitioner is shown as 30- 07-1981."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "75e0b51f1e664e1194236fd94a58d458_121",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, age of the Petitioner is taken as 41 years at the time of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5458a6315bf0449eb9163147aeb484e2_122",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Then the proper multiplier applicable is 14 which comes as follows:\nRs.16,000 x 12 x 14 x 15% = Rs.4,03,200/- Hence, I award Rs.4,03,200/- under the head loss of future earning capacity on account of disability.\n29."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6fd54919039e42ea8854a13eea8e6ad3_123",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Towards future medication the Doctor deposed in his chief examination affidavit that, the Petitioner needs surgery for removal of implants at both sides which would cost around Rs.40,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6531a4adf3b2489cabc10649abf30c92_124",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In private set up."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ffdf06bc9c7e4940a652de78eb231f6c_125",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Neither the Petitioner nor the doctor had produced estimation for Ramesh vs K.S.R.T.C on 20 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/199618399/\n7 future 16 SCCH - 19 MVC.7057/2022 medication."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "057157b98fb647539ad186ebbc7d8088_126",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, by considering the nature of injury and evidence of doctor this tribunal awarded Rs.25,000/- under the head future medical expenses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a0c44cf36a534956a3e280c4e70c0284_127",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(which does not carry any interest)"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ff4459441d9042f88e06c0889068a85f_128",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "30. The Petitioner was Painter profession and due to accidental injuries his routine work was hampered for some days."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ccc645eff18046658af7188105fab834_129",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, by considering this aspect and the nature of injuries sustained by the Petitioner, this tribunal awarded the amount of Rs.15,000/- as reasonable compensation under the head of loss of amenities."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bbe78c1ec17042d48e59870574aa0595_130",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "31. Considering oral evidence coupled with documentary evidence, it is just and proper to grant compensation as follows:\n Under the Heads Amount Pain and sufferings Rs. 80,000-00 Medical expenses, Transpor- tation, 8,000-00 food, Nourishmen"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "09d9b7f5e6d64c08873c9d66455d297e_131",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nTowards future loss of income on Rs. 4,03,200-00 account of permanent disability Towards future medical expenses Rs. 25,000-00"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "32c208450fce4d4ba5036ff9275368cb_132",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Towards loss of amenities of life Rs. 15,000-00 Total Rs.\n5,31,200-00 17 SCCH - 19 MVC.7057/2022 The Petitioner is entitled for total compensation of Rs.5,31,200/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "96ddbe73b35f42a2a492c4b2764a8c90_133",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n32. Interest:\nFor awarding interest"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "545fd0c667994a07887d173c9e07c0ce_134",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ", in MFA.No.103557/2016 (between Sriram General Insurance Co. ltd., V/s Smt. Lakshmi & others, dd 20-03-2018) the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka, held that as per Sec.34 of CPC the rate of interest can be awarded in MVC Cases, cannot be mo"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "69b1a62389f14888ba9cc6d5c32d4bd9_135",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHence, I am of the opinion that, the petitioner is entitled for interest @6% p.a., from the date of petition till the date of payment.\n33. Liability:-\nThe Respondent No.1 is the RC owner-cum- Insurer of KSRTC bus bearing Reg No.KA-57/F- 37"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3327a1d837b24d2399e06dc40968d88b_136",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Respondent No.2 is the Insurer, Respondent No.3 is the owner and as per the Charge sheet the Respondent No.4 is the driver of the Lorry bearing Reg.No.KA-16/D-9498.\n34."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4f6ab7fa050f449eaec3aa67bccc1a7a_137",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the Written statement the respondent No.1 KSRTC contended that, they had paid a sum of Rs.11,356/- to the Petitioner on humanitarian ground without admitting the liability."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "145c1d48ba294fe5b8b3c0be0604154b_138",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But the respondent No.1 had not produced any document 18 SCCH - 19 MVC.7057/2022 to prove that they had paid the amount of Rs.11,356/- to the Petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "74f57ff102574655bb50eac840445cf9_139",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, the said amount cannot be deducted out of total compensation amount."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "71ec2539596849beb224ea59f4e8f77d_141",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As already discussed in the issue No.1 it is proved that, the accident occurred due to rash and negligent driving of the KSRTC Bus driver and also due to negligence in parking of Lorry by it's driver jointly and severally liable to pay comp"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d39ee92bb67948dda43d72e44d7e1516_142",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, the Respondent No.1 is being RC Owner-cum-Insurer of the KSRTC Bus and Respondent No.2 being Insurer of the Lorry are primarily held liable to pay the 50% each of the compensation amount with interest to the Petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d73d613d45424c76976a702ac27f625d_143",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, I answer Issue No.2 Partly in the Affirmative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "212d44c6b2e04546abb326e39a6c6ae8_144",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n36. Issue No.3: for the foregoing reasons, I proceed to pass the following:-\nORDER"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6a5589b862854ff8a9c7c064c5d0f885_145",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The claim petition filed under Section 166 of the Motor Vehicles Act filed by the Petitioners is hereby Partly allowed with cost."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8043fb13288748f9893ae5c74ae6143c_146",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n19 SCCH - 19 MVC.7057/2022"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2388df494803430b932523d12bb0e26e_147",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Petitioner is entitled for total compensation of Rs.5,31,200/- (Rupees five lakh, thirty one thousand and two hundred only) with interest @ 6% p.a., (excluding future medical expenses) from the date of petition till its realization."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ed1a1e8c5f0148cd857a693fd99fc173_148",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Respondent No.1 to 3 are jointly and severally liable to pay aforesaid compensation amount to the Petitioners."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "425bfa319e09410d80c29e5f9aaa4c83_149",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nPetition against Respondent No.4 (i.e., driver of offending vehicle) is hereby dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "623443624e344166a8f8fd084926ea2c_150",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nOut of total compensation amount, the Respondent No.1 is being owner of KSRTC bus and the Respondent No.2 being Insurer of the Lorry are directed to deposit 50% each together with 6%\ninterest p.a. within 60 days, from the date of this Orde"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f5486d8b01b84324983b73c0f0fc6a04_151",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
